#ASSERT `s 568 an offence punishable with imprisonment for five years or less` `imprisonment for life` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 568 an offence punishable with imprisonment for five years or less` `no imprisonment is stated` EQUALS NOTHING   -- the maximum is not stated here
-- 568: the Attorney General may require, unless five years or less (listed: "unless" closes the gate)
