#ASSERT `s 568 the Attorney General may require the accused to be tried by a court composed of a judge and jury` `s 554 test charge I` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- five years and a day
#ASSERT `s 568 the Attorney General may require the accused to be tried by a court composed of a judge and jury` `s 554 test charge G` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- five years: "unless the alleged offence is one that is punishable with imprisonment for five years or less"
#ASSERT `s 568 the Attorney General may require the accused to be tried by a court composed of a judge and jury` `s 554 test charge H` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- five years less a day
#ASSERT `s 568 the Attorney General may require the accused to be tried by a court composed of a judge and jury` `s 554 test charge K` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- no maximum stated
#ASSERT `s 568 the Attorney General may require the accused to be tried by a court composed of a judge and jury` `s 554 test charge A` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- did not elect a judge or provincial court judge: "Even if an accused elects ..."
#ASSERT `s 568 the Attorney General may require the accused to be tried by a court composed of a judge and jury` `s 554 test charge G` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
